{"body":{"model":"opus","reads":{"$ref":"01M6S09BX5DDBXFS8D3EQZG0QR"},"seedFrom":"inside","top":{"$ref":"01M6S74NS6505ZWT7R9Y3JP2SH"},"understandings":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NS6505ZWT7R9Y3JP2SH"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NS7K43G2PTVHZ51QS6E"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NS81M4B6ES70G8QKJTR"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NS9KVQ5RDQQJVC1ZE01"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSA4ZXJX92XWSTSBQD6"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSBJE5M81BQH3BSDTC8"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSC8GS5747410G3QG9S"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSDJJ8KY6NJRM950TS6"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSEBWJFE1P8Y5ZFYFY8"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSFNWJF5MN72ANP730H"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSGFTK8KYP9RDKX1QB5"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSH5PDDB8JQ98353E0K"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSJA251RWE05VHKPBRP"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSKMKCPZ4GBYA3J0QZ5"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSMPF8SK79PP045TWR7"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSN4PKZD00QR785SM0V"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSPRWKCADN7RPBDAJGP"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSQ8HGNR5PRREA5GVTF"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSRC5G34A6BE125565V"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSSNY79D3QG2WFS75EB"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSTSE57K28SX9BZKRW6"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSVHQ2XX286GTQSP5Q7"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSW52WQXKPQYFCX861Y"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSXA9R5HP7JC15F7607"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSYETCKATG8R8XASRH3"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSZPAKGVYMYQRQX42VX"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NT0AS31GMQKVA0TSJJW"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NT1V4Y40JV8QXZKNYR9"}]},"id":"01M6S74NT2F3EQ0Q91W9VRHSHT","instance":["01M6S74NG0JR8Q2S499AF7FR71"],"kind":"version","name":"branch-10","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"where coherence is made to live","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NS7K43G2PTVHZ51QS6E"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSGFTK8KYP9RDKX1QB5"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSN4PKZD00QR785SM0V"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSSNY79D3QG2WFS75EB"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NT1V4Y40JV8QXZKNYR9"}],"prose":"The held space is about parts that refuse to dissolve into the system and yet must act as one. Its weight moves from the parts, to what passes between them, to whoever arranges the passing, and then it is rehearsed and grounded in a place.","title":"Wholes that keep themselves and still meet"},"id":"01M6S74NS6505ZWT7R9Y3JP2SH","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what a part refuses to give up","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NS81M4B6ES70G8QKJTR"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NS9KVQ5RDQQJVC1ZE01"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSA4ZXJX92XWSTSBQD6"}],"prose":"Each part stays whole: it keeps its own model, logic and scope. What it carries is described as kinds of attention it can bring to a shared decision.","title":"The kept self"},"id":"01M6S74NS7K43G2PTVHZ51QS6E","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"level of nesting","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08ZK9JNT733QPVPKKPB33"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZQJDTPV1K5MVEQB7EKC"},{"$ref":"01M6S090806VNZVA97AV0V0XD2"},{"$ref":"01M6S090GX8FSDRJ0E4TJ1H3DX"},{"$ref":"01M6S090KZCM15DWJFKQVKT5TM"},{"$ref":"01M6S090PDBF0YZFN6YMV9WJ5W"}],"prose":"A part is also a whole at another scale; authority runs down the nest while autonomy stays local. The idea travels from philosophy to factories to grids and sites.","title":"Nesting as the first shape"},"id":"01M6S74NS81M4B6ES70G8QKJTR","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"degree of local freedom","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0932TYVDNG7V3F9FPTYPQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S0916BHS51YPSAGK594MMT"},{"$ref":"01M6S0919HQTTW5K4S0JD9BAN6"},{"$ref":"01M6S096SSRKHN58F6YBT2PD3S"},{"$ref":"01M6S0997JNB7G6FJ23GTB226M"}],"prose":"Freedom is graded rather than absolute: a part decides locally within bounds set by its position and the objectives above it.","title":"Autonomy held under constraint"},"id":"01M6S74NS9KVQ5RDQQJVC1ZE01","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what a part is attending to","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NSBJE5M81BQH3BSDTC8"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSC8GS5747410G3QG9S"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSDJJ8KY6NJRM950TS6"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSEBWJFE1P8Y5ZFYFY8"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSFNWJF5MN72ANP730H"}],"prose":"The five new roles read best as five things a part can be looking at: what is right, how far ahead, what things mean, and what the others are doing.","title":"Capacities as kinds of attention"},"id":"01M6S74NSA4ZXJX92XWSTSBQD6","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which norm is checked","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S091HFR7QY67Y0XKA5J0DF"},{"$ref":"01M6S093679WVYX9W76WMQSFYF"},{"$ref":"01M6S093AKQX05TGPX6C9SX1YG"},{"$ref":"01M6S093C3FHWQ6C5YRWRHZ9BN"},{"$ref":"01M6S093FSPTEATFTYCNEJEMQ4"},{"$ref":"01M6S0949YC2RGE7SVC8VQ2BJA"},{"$ref":"01M6S094DC83NRPYHDHCDK6Z0T"},{"$ref":"01M6S094EZEHMWPGCTN09CMTBK"},{"$ref":"01M6S094G14MVA149MAHGZ3JBG"},{"$ref":"01M6S094H6M3N8CRFWQ98BWV6P"},{"$ref":"01M6S094K282XW4C3DANB6FYG7"},{"$ref":"01M6S0974ESZ3BC4PQGRAQ140D"},{"$ref":"01M6S0976Z3XG1JS1A2VTTTBZN"}],"prose":"Ethical and unbiased roles both encode norms as explicit structure, rules or ontologies of known distortions, and check decisions against them.","title":"Attending to rightness"},"id":"01M6S74NSBJE5M81BQH3BSDTC8","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"length of the time horizon","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S093JWWSFCKGZGR3EF21M7"},{"$ref":"01M6S093NFQRR88X9PD990GSFB"},{"$ref":"01M6S093PESAZNQ254MP8QMHMG"},{"$ref":"01M6S093W4DZ6B9GKDGMNA5DED"}],"prose":"The effective role stretches a decision over time and consequence, setting long-term worth against quick economy.","title":"Attending to the horizon"},"id":"01M6S74NSC8GS5747410G3QG9S","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"depth of interpretation","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08Z79ESR6PT11B13KVPB3"},{"$ref":"01M6S093YQ6AXJZ5BM1HF4WFQX"},{"$ref":"01M6S0941499S7BC44BDW6VFZ3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0943RC500MSJR3TQ6FQP3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0944TNASX9K8JK5V5RTRP"},{"$ref":"01M6S09474K3F10PRDVM1JZJ06"}],"prose":"The understanding role turns mixed data into situational meaning through structured vocabularies and inference.","title":"Attending to sense"},"id":"01M6S74NSDJJ8KY6NJRM950TS6","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"breadth of shared awareness","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S094NQQR6J9EGV6K49FTZS"},{"$ref":"01M6S094QH86CGJ2VPFEPRMBRA"},{"$ref":"01M6S094SYAEG8KEJ8AW61YRGQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S094VHECP7DNYBAFKGW3ZP"},{"$ref":"01M6S094XMKX1YC7SH2K1A4ZDZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S0978GWDT0ZWN8XT22K2EJ"}],"prose":"The vigilant role watches across levels so that locally informed parts do not drift globally apart; it shades into the orchestrator.","title":"Attending to the others"},"id":"01M6S74NSEBWJFE1P8Y5ZFYFY8","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"direction of flow between roles","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S094Z5HFC2AJXX9P288K6H"},{"$ref":"01M6S0950DPJQCE6FKYH7TSD58"},{"$ref":"01M6S0951AZ5JE4ABRCQSXWQ2F"},{"$ref":"01M6S0953BG3WSGDTSRPS30552"},{"$ref":"01M6S0953C5H9DMB8CRTPS6YK3"}],"prose":"The roles are wired into a flow: checks feed the balancer, meaning feeds the checks, watching spans all of it.","title":"Attentions feeding one another"},"id":"01M6S74NSFNWJF5MN72ANP730H","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"when agreement is formed","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NSH5PDDB8JQ98353E0K"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSJA251RWE05VHKPBRP"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSKMKCPZ4GBYA3J0QZ5"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSMPF8SK79PP045TWR7"}],"prose":"Because no part gives up its own terms, meaning has to be made where parts touch. The question becomes when agreement forms, and how long it lasts.","title":"The meeting point"},"id":"01M6S74NSGFTK8KYP9RDKX1QB5","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which layer the mismatch sits in","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S090KZCM15DWJFKQVKT5TM"},{"$ref":"01M6S095GRG93K5EG2K71B1CKV"},{"$ref":"01M6S095HBYZ649HND3ZYXDXYT"},{"$ref":"01M6S095HYCF58A43XBQ8GAQ7Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S095KGFWMBWNW19K2CKDZC"},{"$ref":"01M6S095KHNG089YY6CPCTVEGP"},{"$ref":"01M6S095NRWBNYWJEQPXGFXTC5"},{"$ref":"01M6S099046TN4NZCBCFH60P0M"},{"$ref":"01M6S099B342ME391EQMJR2ENW"}],"prose":"Before meeting can be designed, the kinds of mismatch and the layers they occur in are mapped: meaning, organisation, technology; data, service, process, business.","title":"Naming the edges"},"id":"01M6S74NSH5PDDB8JQ98353E0K","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how much is shared in advance","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S095PBA4ZRBXY1GY14VWHR"},{"$ref":"01M6S095Q6V5YHG5EJ40PT2KHP"},{"$ref":"01M6S095RQV1YWJ0PTP40VJPNM"},{"$ref":"01M6S096NJ1YCGW3GT69CTCK3B"},{"$ref":"01M6S0957APBWA2W6N7RK4HA1J"},{"$ref":"01M6S095E1M1ENNRVMHW352873"},{"$ref":"01M6S095WN23Y8DRJGK8C24NJV"},{"$ref":"01M6S0966QJ26TRP3SYCMVVJ1G"},{"$ref":"01M6S09680J8SGQ5QP5F1RE969"}],"prose":"Agreement can be one shared format, one shared middle layer, or none at all with translation case by case. The last is the only one that leaves each part untouched.","title":"Three ways to agree"},"id":"01M6S74NSJA251RWE05VHKPBRP","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"lifespan of a shared meaning","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09654M23DFDXTHS52MBXA"},{"$ref":"01M6S097JQCMENMDG4DXR4V4ZJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S0992KZHB02ZBDX260T244"},{"$ref":"01M6S097N1AM8EGG88P63ZS8D9"}],"prose":"Agreement is formed at runtime as a small, disposable vocabulary for one exchange, then thrown away or revised. Coherence becomes something renewed, not stored.","title":"Meaning made for the moment"},"id":"01M6S74NSKMKCPZ4GBYA3J0QZ5","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what is presupposed rather than built","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0997JNB7G6FJ23GTB226M"},{"$ref":"01M6S096929EE6AD520SWDPK4N"},{"$ref":"01M6S096H49RY8HY208YF1QTMF"},{"$ref":"01M6S098NTTHF9ESCJ8CYMNPR9"},{"$ref":"01M6S098Q89NK293FCZ3EYNTNC"},{"$ref":"01M6S098WFFJ09R57JCXQAZAM3"},{"$ref":"01M6S098YF407XTYGG61RBEPZ7"},{"$ref":"01M6S092VYEKZR8236TWY9GTNW"}],"prose":"The plumbing under the meeting, protocols, formats, security, is named but set aside as given, while standards and scale remain open burdens.","title":"Ground assumed beneath the meeting"},"id":"01M6S74NSMPF8SK79PP045TWR7","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"who holds authority over the joins","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NSPRWKCADN7RPBDAJGP"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSQ8HGNR5PRREA5GVTF"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSRC5G34A6BE125565V"}],"prose":"Once meetings must be made on the fly, someone has to make them; coordination gathers into a single role that binds the others, and the nest regains a top.","title":"The arranger"},"id":"01M6S74NSN4PKZD00QR785SM0V","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"kind of mediation performed","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09710AV583QD1MPBPW32H"},{"$ref":"01M6S097N1AM8EGG88P63ZS8D9"},{"$ref":"01M6S097S811FX4ENN201BA6PM"},{"$ref":"01M6S097VCBK9XZ25KFJF0ND5N"},{"$ref":"01M6S097ZEDYHSVRT1CRE7YFZ3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0981VVD99XQ72EV84VJE6"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZT4PVPYCGQYJV7PR3M5"}],"prose":"The proposed connector translates, aligns goals, merges data and settles conflicts; it carries no task of its own besides holding the rest together.","title":"A part whose work is the others"},"id":"01M6S74NSPRWKCADN7RPBDAJGP","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which component does the linking","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0982Y69VFJ6C8NQBP89NE"},{"$ref":"01M6S0988S3MZFMVE7H1RCZSJZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S098BNS851MZHX3SFT2NYC"},{"$ref":"01M6S098ECD82QGT0KGXZG1EAS"},{"$ref":"01M6S098FH9YH6FMBTFF272DJA"},{"$ref":"01M6S098GRA69D8E61BGJ3ETJF"},{"$ref":"01M6S098HDWNMXMGHDKP7HYH0G"},{"$ref":"01M6S098M0RG9CGW3VBAQ8E35X"}],"prose":"Inside, it is a small machine: a deciding core, a registry of what can link to what, a translator, a finder, and a builder and runner of workflows, with language models proposed for the reasoning and translating parts.","title":"The connector's anatomy"},"id":"01M6S74NSQ8HGNR5PRREA5GVTF","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"where final authority rests","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08ZQJDTPV1K5MVEQB7EKC"},{"$ref":"01M6S095E1M1ENNRVMHW352873"},{"$ref":"01M6S099B342ME391EQMJR2ENW"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A5WEFJY26M01RF4RE1F"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AG184GYEQ79ZCXADC7B"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZK9JNT733QPVPKKPB33"}],"prose":"Decentralisation is the stated aim, yet the arranger ends with the highest authority and may restructure everything below it. Distribution and apex sit side by side.","title":"The top that returns"},"id":"01M6S74NSRC5G34A6BE125565V","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"distance between the system and its double","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NSTSE57K28SX9BZKRW6"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSYETCKATG8R8XASRH3"}],"prose":"The idea is put to work once in a place and once in a rehearsal of that place, where the parts themselves become the actors that run and judge the run.","title":"The whole enacted twice"},"id":"01M6S74NSSNY79D3QG2WFS75EB","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how much the simulated steer the simulation","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NSVHQ2XX286GTQSP5Q7"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSW52WQXKPQYFCX861Y"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NSXA9R5HP7JC15F7607"}],"prose":"Inherited from agent simulation, a ladder is drawn from parts that only report, to parts that react, learn, and finally rewrite the simulation's own rules.","title":"Simulation the parts direct"},"id":"01M6S74NSTSE57K28SX9BZKRW6","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what is inherited from agents","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S091PP1ZZQG6WZ7R3BMA7Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S091YM28K8SWNXGQD94QWR"},{"$ref":"01M6S092GHEZCKHBE4ZKEW3J78"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BPKS0KGT7SR4GE75ACB"}],"prose":"Emergent patterns from simple local rules, and agents that model, support or monitor simulations, are the ancestry; nesting adds levels to it.","title":"Lineage from agents"},"id":"01M6S74NSVHQ2XX286GTQSP5Q7","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"rung of autonomy over the run","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S092KE6ZMECGQSSQBF90BV"},{"$ref":"01M6S092MRCB5DHW2QJWZCMH6P"},{"$ref":"01M6S092NT1X7H7BGXEJM161WB"},{"$ref":"01M6S092PS96FXNTYW0G07YCMZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S092QP2J2DR6DJZ6E197EW"},{"$ref":"01M6S092RHVP4CPW8DAZR8Q3QP"},{"$ref":"01M6S092RXW7KF4BQKGGRPEJTG"},{"$ref":"01M6S092WW0PH5GJ4A54XXD3EV"},{"$ref":"01M6S092XTJ4DM3B12H6CFN807"}],"prose":"Four rungs from passive data source to proactive rule-maker, with the practical demands of each.","title":"The ladder of direction"},"id":"01M6S74NSW52WQXKPQYFCX861Y","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"fidelity of the double to its part","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S099RX7Z7ZGC575Z0RX8W5"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AH0YMYNDBY3FA44T68F"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AH1PWXPQSYN6X82S0CZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AXT9RAEXAGQP942K710"},{"$ref":"01M6S09B0KJPXKB931FZC1JHE3"},{"$ref":"01M6S09B4PEE2MM0G40XAMDENJ"}],"prose":"Each part gets a double in a federation that shares time; the double plays users, flags discrepancies upward, and scores travel time, emissions and access.","title":"The rehearsal in federates"},"id":"01M6S74NSXA9R5HP7JC15F7607","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"where absence becomes visible","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NSZPAKGVYMYQRQX42VX"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NT0AS31GMQKVA0TSJJW"}],"prose":"The roles are cast onto travellers, services, infrastructure and a communication part; the place chosen is defined by what is missing in it.","title":"Mobility as the ground"},"id":"01M6S74NSYETCKATG8R8XASRH3","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which role each actor plays","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S099CXGHQV3WHYC9KRGE4P"},{"$ref":"01M6S099K16DKC7EQQ35ANCYXH"},{"$ref":"01M6S099P1AJBBMKJ6BC76WM36"},{"$ref":"01M6S099QDK964CYS5R06EN4WT"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A2TPJHK2PYS75HJWY0Y"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A2VW9MCRGFVA05NDNK8"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A3PSM31D58SR50QBDQS"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A3Q6P77FKPS24YHHCNW"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A5BW0BNN3HVZ12K0BPE"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A5WEFJY26M01RF4RE1F"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AB69C8H307DTGBZQJX3"}],"prose":"Every abstract role finds a concrete holder, and requests run a numbered path from user to routes and back under the arranger's control.","title":"Casting the roles"},"id":"01M6S74NSZPAKGVYMYQRQX42VX","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what the absence of travel reveals","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S099H77DWSEH2T534Q8NP8"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AG184GYEQ79ZCXADC7B"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BD7Q7DNEGX5EB0MJ8HK"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BAGXSGTE19VJ36NDS5M"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BEWR9X5Z7H9RYYS9WNB"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BX3RAPV03PXJHMR2Z5K"}],"prose":"Beyond routing, the system's second use is to locate places without transport, turning avoidance and silence in the data into a map of need.","title":"Seeing the gaps"},"id":"01M6S74NT0AS31GMQKVA0TSJJW","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
